{"id":"en_daddy-s-sweet-pursuit","title":"Daddy's Sweet Pursuit","titleEn":"Daddy's Sweet Pursuit","description":"Celine Swan had been trapped in a life controlled by John Ludlow, but when he vanished without explanation, she went back to her family home with their daughter. Just as she was settling into a new beginning, their paths crossed once more. Rather than staying apart, the two chose to face their troubles as a family, confronting the people who stood against them and working through the confusion and hurt that had built up between them over the years. For those who want to see how this story unfolds, the series can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/daddys-sweet-pursuit/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/daddys-sweet-pursuit/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Faceslapping","Second Chance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv67g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_daddy-s-sweet-pursuit_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv67g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_daddy-s-sweet-pursuit_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv67g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_daddy-s-sweet-pursuit_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv67g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_daddy-s-sweet-pursuit_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv67g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","down